+# Team invites — implementation plan
+
+Spec: `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-01-team-invites-design.md`
+
+Tasks are grouped by PR, in stack order, following the spec's `## PR Stack`
+section. Each PR has its own branch, started from its base just before that
+PR's first task. Every task is test first: write the failing test, make it
+pass, commit.
+
+Full suite: `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests`
+
+## PR 1 — Add invites table and model
+
+Branch `team-invites/1-schema`, from `main`.
+
+- [ ] **1.1** Commit the spec and this plan.
+- [ ] **1.2** `migrations/005_invites.sql`: the `invites` table, the team/status index and the partial unique index on pending `(team_id, email)`.
+- [ ] **1.3** `app/models/invite.py`: `create`, `find`, `find_pending_for_email`, `list_for_team` (optional status filter, newest first), `revoke`. Emails are normalised; a second pending invite raises `DuplicateInviteError`; revoking a non-pending invite raises `NotPendingError`. Tests in `tests/test_invite_model.py`.
+- [ ] **1.4** Expiry: `expire_overdue`, run by every read in the model. Tests patch `invite._now`.
+- [ ] **1.5** Checkpoint: full suite, then `pr_size.py main team-invites/1-schema`.
+
+## PR 2 — Invite API endpoints
+
+Branch `team-invites/2-api`, from `team-invites/1-schema`.
+
+- [ ] **2.1** `membership.find_for_email`, with a test in `tests/test_memberships.py`.
+- [ ] **2.2** `app/handlers/invites.py`: list and revoke, admin only; register in `app/server.py`. Tests in `tests/test_invites_api.py`, including 401, 403 and 404 for outsiders.
+- [ ] **2.3** Create, with validation: bad email and unknown role are 422, existing member and duplicate pending invite are 409. The response never includes the token.
+- [ ] **2.4** Checkpoint: full suite, then `pr_size.py team-invites/1-schema team-invites/2-api`.
+
+## PR 3 — Invite email delivery
+
+Branch `team-invites/3-email`, from `team-invites/1-schema` (not from PR 2).
+
+- [ ] **3.1** `app/mail/templates/invite.txt` and `send` in `app/mail/invite.py`. Test the rendered subject, recipient and link in `tests/test_invite_mail.py`.
+- [ ] **3.2** `invite.awaiting_email` and `invite.mark_email_queued` in the model; `queue_unsent` in `app/mail/invite.py`. Tests: stamps each invite, skips revoked and expired ones, a second sweep queues nothing.
+- [ ] **3.3** Checkpoint: full suite, then `pr_size.py team-invites/1-schema team-invites/3-email`.
+
+## PR 4 — Invite management screen
+
+Branch `team-invites/4-ui`, from `team-invites/2-api`.
+
+- [ ] **4.1** `layout.page` takes `scripts` (several) instead of `script`; update `team_members.py`.
+- [ ] **4.2** `app/screens/team_invites.py`: the "Pending invites" section with the form, the table and the empty state. `team_members.py` renders it for admins only. Tests in `tests/test_team_screen.py`, including escaping.
+- [ ] **4.3** `app/static/team_invites.js`: submit the form, add the row, revoke with confirmation, show errors. Rows are built with `textContent`.
+- [ ] **4.4** Checkpoint: full suite, then `pr_size.py team-invites/2-api team-invites/4-ui`.
